    "name": "Gravity Blasters",
    "steam_appid": 1468340,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/387cb2f8644ce522ea901152731d4d6d.avif?t=1754394310\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Answer to No One!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your Commander, get your Spaceship, and enter the Battle Arenas to fight for your dream!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add <strong>Gravity Blasters</strong> to your wishlist, support development, gain access to early versions, and enjoy exclusive benefits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Coming Soon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Still in development, <strong>Gravity Blasters</strong> is a real-time multiplayer artillery game that reimagines the classic style of aiming and shooting by adjusting angle and power. But it brings several unique features to the genre:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike most artillery games, <strong>Gravity Blasters</strong> is played <strong>in real time</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is set in <strong>space</strong>, where shots are affected by <strong>planetary gravity</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Projectiles deal damage and can destroy planets and stars</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wide range of <strong>Commanders and Spaceships</strong> with distinct stats, weapons, and special abilities;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple <strong>multiplayer modes</strong> with ranking systems for competitive play;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>story-rich adventure mode</strong> with massive bosses;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced, fun, and addictive</strong> gameplay!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/04e05246636b97084a8fac8366f75c46.avif?t=1754394310\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Aim and Move</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just like in classic artillery games, you can aim, shoot, and move by adjusting your weapon\u2019s angle and power. But beware \u2014 <strong>gravity</strong> will influence your trajectory and movement!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trajectory Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To help manage gravitational interference, your spaceship's AI can simulate the shot\u2019s trajectory \u2014 a great strategy to fine-tune your aim and avoid overheating for nothing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Energy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Energy management is key to survival in space. In <strong>Gravity Blasters</strong>, actions like moving, defending, and shooting consume energy. Use it wisely \u2014 when energy runs low, your options become limited.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Special Shots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Commander has <strong>unique shots, skills, and ultimate powers</strong>. Learn them to gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/f05cb07ed31d82219710d795dc3ffea1.poster.avif?t=1754394310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/f05cb07ed31d82219710d795dc3ffea1.webm?t=1754394310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/f05cb07ed31d82219710d795dc3ffea1.mp4?t=1754394310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/be0278ef1974cf010eb77398351165b4.avif?t=1754394310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/a7a48160eb3bc9217a8567801492efa2.poster.avif?t=1754394310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/a7a48160eb3bc9217a8567801492efa2.webm?t=1754394310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose Your Commander</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick a Commander that fits your playstyle. Each has <strong>unique powers and spaceship abilities</strong>. Level them up to unlock <strong>exclusive skins</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re regularly adding <strong>new Commanders</strong>, along with new ships, powers, and abilities. What kind of power would you like to see? Share your ideas with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Current Commanders:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DX7</strong> \u2013 Heavy weapons expert that can blast enemies across the arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Goliath</strong> \u2013 A natural-born leader who soaks up damage to crush opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Salomea</strong> \u2013 Master of damage over time and energy control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Locus</strong> \u2013 A lone sniper with piercing, high-damage shots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lamp Head</strong> \u2013 A flexible fighter who fires multiple projectiles at once</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/1c6e5b1ef4b8aca018652f6d2bc9c450.avif?t=1754394310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/d2555facf64050aa34a87218c384d4ca.poster.avif?t=1754394310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/d2555facf64050aa34a87218c384d4ca.webm?t=1754394310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Vast Universe Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The universe is filled with alien species and mysterious technology. Each Commander comes with a <strong>unique spaceship</strong> featuring distinct stats, abilities, and ultimate powers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight in Style!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alongside special powers, you can unlock <strong>stunning spaceship skins</strong> to express your identity in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/cf94f103d0a8d69a04d4d5e035dc5d17.avif?t=1754394310\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Battle Against Commanders from Across the Galaxy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create custom battlefields for up to <strong>8 players</strong>, adjusting rules and settings as you like.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free-for-All matches</strong> \u2013 For lone wolves who fight for themselves;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team Battles</strong> \u2013 For those who thrive on coordination and tactics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with <strong>friendly matches</strong> to sharpen your skills, then dive into <strong>ranked battles</strong> to prove your worth and climb the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll fight for <strong>rewards, experience, and resources</strong>. Victory will go to those who master their Commanders!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/387cb2f8644ce522ea901152731d4d6d.avif?t=1754394310\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Answer to No One!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your Commander, get your Spaceship, and enter the Battle Arenas to fight for your dream!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add <strong>Gravity Blasters</strong> to your wishlist, support development, gain access to early versions, and enjoy exclusive benefits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Coming Soon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Still in development, <strong>Gravity Blasters</strong> is a real-time multiplayer artillery game that reimagines the classic style of aiming and shooting by adjusting angle and power. But it brings several unique features to the genre:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike most artillery games, <strong>Gravity Blasters</strong> is played <strong>in real time</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is set in <strong>space</strong>, where shots are affected by <strong>planetary gravity</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Projectiles deal damage and can destroy planets and stars</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wide range of <strong>Commanders and Spaceships</strong> with distinct stats, weapons, and special abilities;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple <strong>multiplayer modes</strong> with ranking systems for competitive play;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>story-rich adventure mode</strong> with massive bosses;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced, fun, and addictive</strong> gameplay!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/04e05246636b97084a8fac8366f75c46.avif?t=1754394310\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Aim and Move</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just like in classic artillery games, you can aim, shoot, and move by adjusting your weapon\u2019s angle and power. But beware \u2014 <strong>gravity</strong> will influence your trajectory and movement!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trajectory Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To help manage gravitational interference, your spaceship's AI can simulate the shot\u2019s trajectory \u2014 a great strategy to fine-tune your aim and avoid overheating for nothing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Energy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Energy management is key to survival in space. In <strong>Gravity Blasters</strong>, actions like moving, defending, and shooting consume energy. Use it wisely \u2014 when energy runs low, your options become limited.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Special Shots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Commander has <strong>unique shots, skills, and ultimate powers</strong>. Learn them to gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/f05cb07ed31d82219710d795dc3ffea1.poster.avif?t=1754394310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/f05cb07ed31d82219710d795dc3ffea1.webm?t=1754394310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/f05cb07ed31d82219710d795dc3ffea1.mp4?t=1754394310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/be0278ef1974cf010eb77398351165b4.avif?t=1754394310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/a7a48160eb3bc9217a8567801492efa2.poster.avif?t=1754394310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/a7a48160eb3bc9217a8567801492efa2.webm?t=1754394310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose Your Commander</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick a Commander that fits your playstyle. Each has <strong>unique powers and spaceship abilities</strong>. Level them up to unlock <strong>exclusive skins</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re regularly adding <strong>new Commanders</strong>, along with new ships, powers, and abilities. What kind of power would you like to see? Share your ideas with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Current Commanders:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DX7</strong> \u2013 Heavy weapons expert that can blast enemies across the arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Goliath</strong> \u2013 A natural-born leader who soaks up damage to crush opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Salomea</strong> \u2013 Master of damage over time and energy control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Locus</strong> \u2013 A lone sniper with piercing, high-damage shots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lamp Head</strong> \u2013 A flexible fighter who fires multiple projectiles at once</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/1c6e5b1ef4b8aca018652f6d2bc9c450.avif?t=1754394310\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/d2555facf64050aa34a87218c384d4ca.poster.avif?t=1754394310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/d2555facf64050aa34a87218c384d4ca.webm?t=1754394310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Vast Universe Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The universe is filled with alien species and mysterious technology. Each Commander comes with a <strong>unique spaceship</strong> featuring distinct stats, abilities, and ultimate powers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight in Style!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alongside special powers, you can unlock <strong>stunning spaceship skins</strong> to express your identity in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468340/extras/cf94f103d0a8d69a04d4d5e035dc5d17.avif?t=1754394310\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Battle Against Commanders from Across the Galaxy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create custom battlefields for up to <strong>8 players</strong>, adjusting rules and settings as you like.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free-for-All matches</strong> \u2013 For lone wolves who fight for themselves;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team Battles</strong> \u2013 For those who thrive on coordination and tactics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with <strong>friendly matches</strong> to sharpen your skills, then dive into <strong>ranked battles</strong> to prove your worth and climb the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll fight for <strong>rewards, experience, and resources</strong>. Victory will go to those who master their Commanders!</p>",
